### Create a new post
POST http://localhost:3000/posts/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer test-token

{
    "title": "Post title v1",
    "content": "Post content example v2",
    "keywords": [
        "k1",
        "k2",
        "k3"
    ]
}


### Fetch All posts
GET http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json


### Delete post by uuid
DELETE http://localhost:3000/posts/delete/a60bf854-893d-4a37-9a60-4e778fd4cbe0
Content-Type: application/json